674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zf6AYsIOSM4Q7kNvwGa3L9y&_nc_oc=AdqqyWsgt-bg1BM5nxO093lgIcdCxPTO1jofdHjPV4BL_-20hG2s1I_sSlw-mM3ha74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7FUxGIgHV2l80i5IPlHkCliof5MFFp8qyh_-3Kg_-D5g&oe=6A130BD9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I0EGwm3jc5gQ7kNvwFb8CPV&_nc_oc=AdqXKaSIz7V16dXI0aoRfayx5EdcMd3Lr8RMWWrEZyQX3eYV6snIO1EM9DwrKT7i8MY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af630fpWTuHLNYkSkOCzDoJLdNH095VdMJvV1FaJBMlj5w&oe=6A131496"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_Tm1fjzYfToQ7kNvwH3ZSDa&_nc_oc=Ado3w2Y7ULRaNv9oQYODorigjMEvxCVxVVs4_ieopmIW0Q15E9-DqbY8m4tAp3YqOK8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6lTnKxqm367JG6YwNX42mBESHpYkbJH7RJxViZ2p1VjA&oe=6A1310B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip